# Docs Mapping

Purpose:
  1:1 mapping between AI-readable project/ and human-readable docs/.
  Every file in project/ has a corresponding doc in docs/.

Mapping:
  project/modules/ → docs/10-business/modules/
  project/components/ → docs/20-architecture/components/
  project/api/ → docs/30-backend/api/
  project/data/ → docs/60-database/schemas/

Rules:
  [DM1] Every project/ file MUST have a docs/ counterpart.
  [DM2] docs/ MUST be human-readable Markdown.
  [DM3] project/ MUST be AI-readable .sdd format.
  [DM4] Changes to project/ MUST update docs/ simultaneously.
  [DM5] Docs MUST explain WHY, not just WHAT.
  [DM6] Docs MUST include business context.
  [DM7] Docs MUST be versioned with project/.

Navigation:
  Project: @project/INDEX.sdd
  Docs: @docs/INDEX.sdd
  Modules: @project/modules/
  Components: @project/components/
  API: @project/api/
  Data: @project/data/

State: +
